; File icons for the languages Visual Studio has none for. C, C++ and header files keep the built-in Visual C++ icons
; (KnownMonikers.CFile / CPPFileNode / CPPHeaderFile); .kt, .kts and .properties are in KotlinFiles.pkgdef.
; Image ids: Icons/Languages.imagemanifest (same order as Vistudio.Core LanguageIcons).

[$RootKey$\ShellFileAssociations\.dart]
"DefaultIconMoniker"="2d0f6a15-591d-4131-b160-d834f3945b8f:1"

